<title>INDIA: Asahi India Safety bonus meet today.</title>
<headline>Asahi India Safety bonus meet today.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Asahi India Safety Glass will meet later on Monday to consider an issue of bonus shares, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said in a notice.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
